e this place.\u2019\\n\\n\u201cFelix trembled violently as he spoke. He and his companion entered the cottage, where they stayed for a few minutes, and then left. I never saw another member of the De Lacey family again.\\n\\n\u201cI remained in my shelter for the rest of the day, sunk in complete and senseless despair. My protectors had gone and had broken the only bond connecting me to the world. For the first time, revenge and hatred filled my heart. I did not try to restrain them. Letting myself be carried along by these feelings, I turned my thoughts toward causing harm and death.\u201d\"}"
