 months before suspicion arose. Months! Everything could be destroyed well before then.\\n\\nA sudden idea came to him. He put on his fur coat and hat and went into the hall. There he stopped, hearing the policeman\u2019s slow, heavy footsteps on the pavement outside and seeing the bull\u2019s-eye flash reflected in the window. He waited, holding his breath.\\n\\nAfter a few moments, he lifted the latch and slipped out, closing the door very softly behind him. Then he began to ring the bell.\"}"
