le and searched everywhere for the missing money. Then the duke said:\\n\\n\u201cWell, he was a very sick man, and likely he made a mistake\u2014I reckon that\u2019s how it happened. The best thing is to let it go and say nothing about it. We can afford it.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cOh, nonsense, yes, we can afford it. I don\u2019t care about that\u2014it\u2019s the counting I\u2019m thinking about. We want to be completely honest and open here, you know. We want to carry this money upstairs and count it in front of everybody\u2014then there won\u2019t be anything suspicious. But when the dead man says there\u2019s six thousand dollars, you know, we don\u2019t want to\u2014\u201d\"}"
