uld not possibly see.\\n\\nWe retraced our steps, returned to the front of the house, rang, and, after showing our credentials, were admitted by the officers in charge. We went upstairs into the room where the body of Mademoiselle L\u2019Espanaye had been found, and where both victims still lay. As usual, the room had been left in its disordered state. I saw nothing beyond what had been reported in the \u201cGazette des Tribunaux.\u201d Dupin examined everything, including the bodies of the victims. We then entered the other rooms and went into the yard, accompanied throughout by a _gendarme_.\"}"
