          "text": "{\"request_id\":\"08860348d8cfa5a81edc4c4e\",\"rewritten_text\":\"\u201cWell, Jup,\u201d I said, \u201cwhat is the matter now? How is your master?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cTo speak the truth, massa, he isn\u2019t as well as he might be.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNot well! I\u2019m truly sorry to hear that. What does he complain of?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThat\u2019s just it! He never complains of anything\u2014but he\u2019s very sick all the same.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cVery sick, Jupiter! Why didn\u2019t you say so at once? Is he confined to bed?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNo, he isn\u2019t! He isn\u2019t confined anywhere\u2014that\u2019s exactly where the trouble lies. I\u2019m very worried about poor Massa Will.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cJupiter, I\u2019d like to understand what you\u2019re talking about. You say your master is sick. Hasn\u2019t he told you what\u2019s wrong with him?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWell, massa, there\u2019s no use getting angry about it. Massa Will says there\u2019s nothing wrong with him\u2014but then why does he go around looking like this, with his head down and his shoulders raised, and as white as a goose? And then he keeps a cipher all the time\u2014\u201d\\n\\n\u201cKeeps a what, Jupiter?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cKeeps a cipher with figures on the slate\u2014the strangest figures I ever saw. I\u2019m getting frightened, I tell you. I have to keep a very close eye on him wherever he goes. The other day he slipped away before sunrise and was gone the whole blessed day. I had a big stick cut and ready to give him a devil of a beating when he came back\u2014but I\u2019m such a fool that I couldn\u2019t bring myself to do it after all\u2014he looked so very ill.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cEh? What? Ah, yes! On the whole, I think you\u2019d better not be too severe with the poor fellow. Don\u2019t flog him, Jupiter\u2014he can\u2019t very well endure it. But can\u2019t you form any idea what caused this illness, or rather this change in his behavior? Has anything unpleasant happened since I saw you?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNo, massa, nothing unpleasant has happened since then\u2014I\u2019m afraid it was before then\u2014it was the very day you were there.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cHow? What do you mean?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWell, massa, I mean the bug\u2014there it is.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThe what?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThe bug\u2014I\u2019m certain Massa Will was bitten somewhere around the head by that golden bug.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cAnd what reason have you, Jupiter, for such a supposition?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cClaws enough, massa, and a mouth too. I never saw such a devilish bug\u2014it kicked and bit everything that came near it. Massa Will caught it first, but had to let it go again very quickly, I tell you\u2014that must have been when he got bitten. I didn\u2019t like the look of the bug\u2019s mouth myself, not at all, so I wouldn\u2019t pick it up with my fingers, but I caught it with a piece of paper I found.\u201d\"}"
