poke.\\n\\n\u201cI never imagined,\u201d said Estella, \u201cthat I would say goodbye to you while saying goodbye to this place. I am very glad to do so.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cGlad to part again, Estella? To me, parting is painful. The memory of our last parting has always been sad and painful.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cBut you said to me,\u201d Estella replied, very earnestly, \u201c\u2018God bless you, God forgive you!\u2019 And if you could say that to me then, you will not hesitate to say it now\u2014now, when suffering has taught me more powerfully than anything else, and has taught me to understand what your heart once was. I have been bent and broken, but\u2014I hope\u2014into a better shape.\u201d\"}"
