          "text": "{\"request_id\":\"02d6532c7a4ec89d4bceefb9\",\"rewritten_text\":\"\u201cI\u2019m gwine, Massa Will\u2014deed I is,\u201d the negro answered promptly\u2014\u201cmos\u2019 to de eend now.\u201d\\n\\n\u201c_To the end!_\u201d Legrand fairly shrieked. \u201cDo you mean you are at the end of that limb?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cSoon be at de eend, massa\u2014o-o-o-o-oh! Lor-gol-a-marcy! what\u2019s dis here pon de tree?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWell!\u201d cried Legrand, greatly pleased, \u201cwhat is it?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, \u2019tain\u2019t noffin but a skull\u2014somebody lef\u2019 his head up de tree, and de crows done gobble every bit ob de meat off.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cA skull, you say! Very well\u2014how is it secured to the limb? What keeps it there?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cSure nuff, massa; mus\u2019 look. Why, dis berry curous sarcumstance, pon my word\u2014dare\u2019s a great big nail in de skull, fastenin\u2019 it to de tree.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNow, Jupiter, do precisely as I tell you\u2014do you hear?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cYes, massa.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThen pay attention\u2014locate the skull\u2019s left eye.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cHum! hoo! dat\u2019s good! Why, dare ain\u2019t no eye lef\u2019 at all.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cCurse your stupidity! Do you know your right hand from your left?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cYes, I knows dat\u2014knows all about dat\u2014\u2019tis my lef\u2019 hand what I chops de wood wid.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cOf course! You are left-handed, and your left eye is on the same side as your left hand. So I suppose you can find the skull\u2019s left eye, or the spot where its left eye was. Have you found it?\u201d\\n\\nThere was a lengthy pause. At last the negro asked,\\n\\n\u201cIs de lef\u2019 eye ob de skull on de same side as de lef\u2019 hand ob de skull, too?\u2014\u2019cause de skull ain\u2019t got not a bit ob a hand at all\u2014nebber mind! I got de lef\u2019 eye now\u2014here de lef\u2019 eye! What mus\u2019 I do wid it?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cLet the beetle pass through