have a grandfather, and much more than that to have a family Ghost.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018 I don\u2019t think I would like America.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018I suppose that is because we have no ruins and no curiosities,\u2019 said Virginia sarcastically.\\n\\n\u2018No ruins! No curiosities!\u2019 replied the Ghost. \u2018You have your navy and your manners.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Good evening. I will go and ask Papa to give the twins an extra week\u2019s holiday.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Please don\u2019t go, Miss Virginia,\u2019 he cried. \u2018I am so lonely and unhappy, and I truly don\u2019t know what to do. I want to go to sleep, but I cannot.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018That is absurd! You only have to go to bed and blow out the candle.\u2019\"}"
