pted child with knowledge, growing more attached to him as his character unfolded and revealed the flourishing seeds of all he hoped the boy would become\u2014how he discovered in him new traits of his early friend, awakening in his own heart old memories, melancholy yet sweet and comforting\u2014how the two orphans, tested by adversity, remembered its lessons in mercy toward others, mutual love, and fervent gratitude to Him who had protected and preserved them\u2014these are matters that need not be told.\"}"
