          "text": "{\"request_id\":\"b8d1a165e81bb5c407a8a10e\",\"rewritten_text\":\"\u2018Starve you to death? Oh, Mr. Ghost\u2014I mean Sir Simon\u2014are you hungry? I have a sandwich in my case. Would you like it?\u2019\\n\\n\u2018No, thank you. I never eat anything now; but it is very kind of you, all the same. You are much nicer than the rest of your horrid, rude, vulgar, dishonest family.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Stop!\u2019 cried Virginia, stamping her foot. \u2018You are the rude, horrid, vulgar one. And as for dishonesty, you know you stole the paints from my box to touch up that ridiculous bloodstain in the library. First you took all my reds, including the vermilion, so I couldn\u2019t paint any more sunsets. Then you took the emerald green and the chrome yellow. In the end, I had nothing left but indigo and Chinese white, and could paint only moonlight scenes, which are always depressing to look at and very difficult to paint. I never told on you, although I was extremely annoyed. The whole thing was ridiculous; who ever heard of emerald-green blood?\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Well, really,\u2019 said the Ghost rather meekly, \u2018what was I supposed to do? Real blood is very difficult to get nowadays. And since your brother started it all with his Paragon Detergent, I saw no reason why I shouldn\u2019t use your paints. As for color, that is always a matter of taste. The Cantervilles have blue blood, for example\u2014the bluest in England. But I know you Americans don\u2019t care about such things.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018You know nothing about it. The best thing you can do is emigrate and improve your mind. My father will be delighted to give you a free passage. And although there is a heavy duty on spirits of every kind, there will be no trouble at Customs, since the officers are all Democrats. Once you reach New York, you are sure to be a great success. I know many people there who would pay a hundred thousand dollars to have a grandfather, and much more than that to have a family Ghost.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018I don\u2019t think I would like America.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018I suppose that is because we have no ruins or curiosities,\u2019 said Virginia sarcastically.\\n\\n\u2018No ruins! No curiosities!\u2019 replied the Ghost. \u2018You have your navy and your manners.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Good evening. I will ask Papa to give the twins an extra week\u2019s holiday.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Please don\u2019t go, Miss Virginia,\u2019 he cried. \u2018I am so lonely and unhappy, and I truly don\u2019t know what to do. I want to go to sleep, but I cannot.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018That is absurd! You only have to go to bed and blow out the candle.\u2019\"}"
