 possession of your house and let me flee this place.\u2019\\n\\n\u201cFelix trembled violently as he spoke. He and his companion entered the cottage, where they remained for a few minutes, and then left. I never saw another member of the De Lacey family.\\n\\n\u201cI spent the rest of the day in my hovel, sunk in complete and senseless despair. My protectors had gone and severed the only bond that connected me to the world. For the first time, revenge and hatred filled my heart. I made no effort to restrain them; surrendering myself to the current, I turned my thoughts toward harm and death.\u201d\"}"
