f the room. It stood open, with its contents scattered on the floor beside it. The victims must have been sitting with their backs to the window. Since some time passed between the animal\u2019s entrance and the screams, it probably was not noticed at once. The shutter slamming shut would naturally have been blamed on the wind.\\n\\nAs the sailor looked inside, the huge animal had seized Madame L\u2019Espanaye by her hair, which was loose because she had been combing it, and was waving the razor around her face, copying a barber\u2019s movements.\"}"
