mself, was rather startled by the request and murmured, with great deference, something about a medical certificate being required. But when Lord Arthur explained that the poison was intended for a large Norwegian mastiff he had to destroy, since it appeared to be developing rabies and had already bitten the coachman twice in the calf, he declared himself entirely satisfied, praised Lord Arthur\u2019s remarkable knowledge of toxicology, and had the prescription prepared at once.\\n\\nLord Arthur placed the capsule in a charming little silver _bonbonni\u00e8re_ he noticed in a Bond Street shop window, discarded Pestle and Humbey\u2019s unattractive pill-box, and drove immediately to Lady Clementina\u2019s.\"}"
