ardly say why. Perhaps it was more a wish than a real belief. But do you know that Jupiter\u2019s foolish words about the bug being made of solid gold had a remarkable effect on my imagination? Then there was the whole series of accidents and coincidences, which was truly extraordinary. Do you see how accidental it was that these events happened on the only day of the year when it was, or might be, cool enough for a fire? Without the fire\u2014or without the dog appearing at exactly the moment he did\u2014I would never have noticed the death\u2019s-head, and therefore would never have possessed the treasure?\u201d\"}"
