cDon\u2019t ask for it unless you want it, Peter.\u201d\\n\\nBut Peter made it clear that he did want it.\\n\\n\u201cYou\u2019d better be sure.\u201d\\n\\nPeter was sure.\\n\\n\u201cNow that you\u2019ve asked for it, I\u2019ll give it to you, because there\u2019s nothing mean about me. But if you find you don\u2019t like it, you must blame no one but yourself.\u201d\\n\\nPeter agreed. So Tom forced open his mouth and poured in the Pain-killer. Peter leaped several feet into the air, gave a war whoop, and raced around the room, crashing into furniture, knocking over flowerpots, and causing complete chaos.\"}"
