oke himself and never told a soul. Well, I felt sheepish enough at being taken in, but I wouldn\u2019t have traded places with that ringmaster for a thousand dollars. I don\u2019t know; there may be better circuses than that one, but I\u2019ve never come across them yet. Anyway, it was good enough for me; and wherever I find it, it can have all my custom every time.\"}"
