nd wife. The Vengeance joined in the conversation like a regular member of the establishment.\\n\\nWhen Carton entered, took a seat, and asked, in very indifferent French, for a small measure of wine, Madame Defarge gave him a careless glance, then a sharper one, then a sharper still, and finally approached him herself to ask what he had ordered.\\n\\nHe repeated what he had already said.\\n\\n\u201cEnglish?\u201d Madame Defarge asked, raising her dark eyebrows inquisitively.\\n\\nAfter looking at her as though even the sound of a single French word took him time to understand, he answered in the same strong foreign accent as before.\"}"
