he matter. First I considered how the parchment had come into my possession. The place where we found the _scarab\u00e6us_ lay on the mainland coast, about a mile east of the island, and only a short distance above high-water mark. When I picked it up, it gave me a sharp bite, making me drop it. Jupiter, with his usual caution, before taking hold of the insect, which had flown toward him, searched around for a leaf or something similar with which to seize it.\"}"
