ther there have been so many people that I could not see the pictures, which was terrible, or so many pictures that I could not see the people, which was worse. The Grosvenor is really the only place.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cI don\u2019t think I shall send it anywhere,\u201d he replied, throwing his head back in that odd manner that had once made his friends laugh at him at Oxford.\"}"
