9twas before den, I fear\u2014\u2019twas de very day you was dare.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cHow? What do you mean?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, massa, I mean de bug\u2014dare now.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThe what?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cDe bug\u2014I\u2019m berry certain Massa Will was bitten somewhere \u2019bout de head by dat gold-bug.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cAnd what reason have you, Jupiter, for such a belief?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cClaws enough, massa, and a mouth too. I never did see such a devilish bug\u2014he kicked and bit everything that came near him. Massa Will caught him first, but had to let him go again mighty quick, I tell you\u2014that must have been when he got bitten. I didn\u2019t like de look of de bug\u2019s mouth myself, nohow, so I wouldn\u2019t take hold of him wid my fingers, but I caught him with a piece of paper dat I found.\u201d\"}"
