re until he gives everything away? No, sir; I knew what I would do. I\u2019d wait, and when he came back, if he said he had to go anywhere else, I\u2019d get down there too, even if I had to swim. Then we\u2019d tie him up, keep him, and head downriver; and when Tom was finished with him, we\u2019d pay him whatever it was worth\u2014or all we had\u2014and then let him get ashore.\\n\\nSo I crawled into a lumber pile to sleep. The next time I woke, the sun was high overhead! I rushed out and went to the doctor\u2019s house, but they told me he had left sometime during the night and had not returned yet.\"}"
