ise, that my partner was at the door with one of the murderers in custody, and asked whether she would kindly go out and tell him he need not wait, but should hurry to the far end of the back alley and be ready to head the slave off when I drove him out.\\n\\nShe was bursting with eagerness to see one of the already famous murderers, and she set off on the errand at once.\"}"
