ous Roman capitals.\\n\\n\u201cGood heavens!\u201d said the undertaker, taking Mr. Bumble by the gold-edged lapel of his official coat. \u201cThat is exactly what I wanted to speak to you about. You know\u2014dear me, what an elegant button this is, Mr. Bumble! I never noticed it before.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cYes, I think it is rather attractive,\u201d said the beadle, looking proudly down at the large brass buttons decorating his coat. \u201cThe design is the same as the parish seal\u2014the Good Samaritan healing the sick and wounded man. The board gave it to me on New Year\u2019s morning, Mr. Sowerberry. I remember wearing it for the first time when I attended the inquest on that ruined tradesman who died in a doorway at midnight.\u201d\"}"
