ould sit in the same room with. I reminded him that I was your friend and asked what he meant. He told me. He said it openly, in front of everyone. It was horrible! Why is your friendship so disastrous for young men? There was that wretched boy in the Guards who killed himself. You were his closest friend. There was Sir Henry Ashton, who had to leave England with his name disgraced.\u201d\"}"
