g under the best possible circumstances\u2014there would be no troublesome uncertainty about where to dig. They nudged each other constantly, eloquent nudges that were easy to understand, meaning simply: \u201cOh, but aren\u2019t you glad now that we\u2019re here!\u201d\\n\\nJoe\u2019s knife struck something.\\n\\n\u201cHello!\u201d he said.\\n\\n\u201cWhat is it?\u201d his companion asked.\\n\\n\u201cHalf-rotten plank\u2014no, I think it\u2019s a box. Here\u2014lend a hand and we\u2019ll find out what it\u2019s doing here. Never mind, I\u2019ve made a hole.\u201d\\n\\nHe reached inside and pulled out\u2014\\n\\n\u201cMan, it\u2019s money!\u201d\\n\\nThe two men examined the handful of coins. They were gold. The boys above were just as excited and delighted as the men themselves.\\n\\nJoe\u2019s companion said:\\n\\n\u201cWe\u2019ll make short work of this. There\u2019s an old rusty pick among the weeds in the corner on the other side of the fireplace\u2014I saw it a minute ago.\u201d\"}"
