ntil I\u2019m over eighty.\u2019\\n\\nIt was the box that had contained the aconitine.\\n\\nLord Arthur started, and a slight flush touched his cheek. He had almost completely forgotten what he had done, and it struck him as a strange coincidence that Sybil, for whose sake he had endured all that dreadful anxiety, should be the first to recall it to him.\\n\\n\u2018Of course you may have it, Sybil. I gave it to poor Lady Clementina myself.\u2019\\n\\n\u2018Oh, thank you, Arthur; and may I have the _bonbon_ as well? I had no idea Lady Clementina enjoyed sweets. I thought she was much too intellectual.\u2019\\n\\nLord Arthur turned deathly pale, and a terrible thought passed through his mind.\"}"
