 right eye toward the object, puffed, paused, waddled around, and grunted meaningfully\u2014then waddled back, grunted, paused, and at last puffed again.\\n\\nMeanwhile, the object that had caused so much curiosity and smoke came lower and lower toward the good city. Within a few minutes it was close enough to be seen clearly. It appeared to be\u2014yes, it was certainly a kind of balloon; but Rotterdam had surely never seen such a balloon before.\"}"
