ficulty. After some effort, I brought them to right angles with the body of the buckle, and was pleased to find that they stayed firmly in place. Holding this tool between my teeth, I began to untie my cravat. I had to stop several times before I could complete the task, but at last I succeeded.\u201d\"}"
