eived his nickel\u2014the king himself hanging it around his neck\u2014and was dismissed. Would you believe that this could cure anyone? It certainly did. Any ritual will cure if the patient\u2019s faith in it is strong enough. Near Astolat stood a chapel where the Virgin had once appeared to a girl who used to herd geese there\u2014the girl said so herself. They built the chapel on that spot and hung inside it a picture depicting the event, a picture you might think dangerous for a sick person even to approach. Yet thousands of the lame and sick came to pray before it every year and went away healed and sound; even the healthy could look upon it and live.\"}"
